      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "三个数列各项均非零，且相邻两项的比与$n$无关，因此都是等比数列。\na) $\\frac{c_{n+1}}{c_n}=\\frac{2^{n+1}}{2^n}=2$；\nb) $\\frac{c_{n+1}}{c_n}=\\frac{5\\cdot3^{n+1}}{5\\cdot3^n}=3$；\nc) $\\frac{c_{n+1}}{c_n}=\\frac{3\\cdot2^{n+2}}{3\\cdot2^{n+1}}=2$。",
      "parts": [],
      "historical_entities": [],
      "notes": "A proof is required, not merely numerical ratios; the complete ratio argument is displayed."
